exports[`Diagnostic Showcase Documentation.es should render the same report every time 1`] = `
"[missing-documentation-separator]
Warning: This '@param' tag is not separated from its text
   ╭─┤ Documentation.es:7:20 │
   │
 7 │     §§ @param subject who to greet
   │                       ──────┬─────  
   │                             ╰─────── an em-dash belongs here
   │ 
   │ Help: Write '@param subject —' before the text.
   │ 
   │ Note 1: A tag carrying its text on its own line separates the two with an em-dash — that is where the description begins, and how an Editor renders the tag back. A tag that leaves its text to the lines below it needs no separator.
   │ Note 2: The text is lifted into the Documentation either way; what is missing is the separator, not the description.
───╯

[missing-documentation-separator]
Warning: This '@returns' tag is not separated from its text
   ╭─┤ Documentation.es:8:14 │
   │
 8 │     §§ @returns the finished greeting
   │                 ──────────┬──────────  
   │                           ╰──────────── an em-dash belongs here
   │ 
   │ Help: Write '@returns —' before the text.
   │ 
   │ Note 1: A tag carrying its text on its own line separates the two with an em-dash — that is where the description begins, and how an Editor renders the tag back. A tag that leaves its text to the lines below it needs no separator.
   │ Note 2: The text is lifted into the Documentation either way; what is missing is the separator, not the description.
───╯

[misnamed-documentation-parameter]
