    │               ─┬─  
    │                ╰─── Parameter 1 is 'left'
    │ 
    │ Help: Write '@param left'.
    │ 
    │ Note 1: A '@param' line documents the Parameter at its own position — the first line the first Parameter — and names it the way the signature does: its label, or '_' where it carries none.
    │ Note 2: The Parameters are 'left', 'right', in that order.
────╯

